{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast and intense CO-OP focused battle arena featuring rapid progression and randomized waves of increasingly more difficult enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843850/extras/74b5b7fe7c2dc9a92b908fa9da4adabb.poster.avif?t=1759525461\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843850/extras/74b5b7fe7c2dc9a92b908fa9da4adabb.webm?t=1759525461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843850/extras/74b5b7fe7c2dc9a92b908fa9da4adabb.mp4?t=1759525461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT\u2019S IN THE GAME?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A array of battle arenas, each presenting varied and evolving layouts, hazards, and challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90 unique abilities and augments derived from 9 elements: Fire, Light, Ice, Decay, Terra, Wind, Lightning, Void, and Chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >99 upgrades for abilities and augments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 upgradeable device powers which enhance player progression across playthrough attempts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 unique enemy types, including\u00a0 7 multi-stage boss encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 multi-tier endgame challenge modes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless mode allowing you to push yourself and the game to the absolute limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player or cooperative multiplayer up to 4 players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steam